#: angular/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A standalone Angular app (via Vite + `@analogjs/vite-plugin-angular`, no "
"Angular CLI) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and\n"
"[`@pantoken/angular`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/angular) "
"(pantoken custom elements\n"
"for Angular).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` calls `registerPantokenElements()` (from `@pantoken/"
"angular`) once at bootstrap so\n"
"  elements like `<instui-icon>` work in templates, and imports the token/"
"component CSS plus\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box).\n"
"- `src/app.component.ts` is a standalone component (`CUSTOM_ELEMENTS_SCHEMA` "
"lets the template\n"
"  compiler accept pantoken's custom element tags) whose template is styled "
"with `instui-*`\n"
"  classes; optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) "
"are marked with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [getting started guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Feidhmchlár Angular neamhspleách (trí Vite + `@analogjs/vite-plugin-"
"angular`, gan Angular CLI) stílithe le\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"agus\n"
"[`@pantoken/angular`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/angular) "
"(eilimintí saincheaptha\n"
"pantoken do Angular).\n"
"\n"
"## Forbairt\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Cad atá anseo\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` glaonn ar `registerPantokenElements()` (ó `@pantoken/"
"angular`) uair amháin ag bootstrap chun go n-oibrítear eilimintí ar nós\n"
"  `<instui-icon>` i templates, agus a iomláithin an token/component CSS "
"agus\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (socraítear suas modal, tooltip, agus iompraítí "
"comhpháirt eile go bhfíordhíreach).\n"
"- Is comhpháirt neamhspleách é `src/app.component.ts` "
"(`CUSTOM_ELEMENTS_SCHEMA` a cheadaíonn don\n"
"  chóiméadóir teimpléad shonracha phantoken a ghlacadh) agus an teimpléad á "
"stíliú le\n"
"  `instui-*` ranganna; marcáiltear pointí ionseartha roghnach (ceannáil, "
"scagthóirí,\n"
"  ábhar, deireanach) le `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Cuir i bhfeidhm ranganna ar nós `class=\"instui-button\"` ar mharcáil; "
"féach an\n"
"  [tagairt chomhpháirt](https://pantoken.app/api/css) chun an liosta iomlán "
"ranga a fháil.\n"
"\n"
"## Foghlaim níos mó\n"
"\n"
"Féach an [treoir tosaithe](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) chun "
"foghlaim níos mó.\n"

#: canvas-theme-editor/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Upload-ready assets for Canvas LMS's **Theme Editor**, plus a local preview "
"for authoring Rich\n"
"Content Editor (RCE) page templates styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `theme.css` / `theme.js` — upload these two files under **Theme Editor → "
"Advanced** in Canvas.\n"
"  They're built for the CDN provider/theme/mode you chose when scaffolding "
"(`--cdn`/`--theme`/\n"
"  `--theme-mode`; jsDelivr/rebrand/light by default) and include a loader "
"for\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up component behaviors like modal, "
"tooltip, and drilldown).\n"
"- `index.html` / `src/main.ts` — a local, TinyMCE-based editor (`npm run "
"dev`) that mirrors Canvas's\n"
"  RCE so you can author page templates against pantoken's classes before "
"copying them into Canvas.\n"
"  The page itself is built with pantoken's `wrapper` layout: click **Edit "
"theme** to open a tray\n"
"  with **Config** / **CSS** / **JS** tabs (CDN provider/theme/mode selects, "
"and syntax-highlighted,\n"
"  hand-editable copies of `theme.css`/`theme.js` that feed the live "
"preview), and the **?** button\n"
"  for full instructions. Use the **Layouts** toolbar button to start from "
"one of pantoken's bundled\n"
"  starter page layouts (hero, callout, two-column, rubric note, "
"testimonial), sourced from\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"This opens a Vite dev server with:\n"
"\n"
"- An **editor** pane (TinyMCE, matching the version/config\n"
"  [instructure/canvas-lms](https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms) itself "
"uses — see below).\n"
"  Use the **Layouts** button to load one of the bundled starter layouts "
"(this replaces the whole\n"
"  document, after a confirm, rather than inserting at the cursor), and the "
"**Source code** toggle\n"
"  to hand-edit the raw HTML in a syntax-highlighted (CodeMirror) view "
"alongside the editor, with\n"
"  the preview pane updating live as you type — unlike TinyMCE's stock `code` "
"plugin, which edits in\n"
"  a one-shot modal dialog with no live preview.\n"
"- A **preview** pane showing the editor's content with the current CSS/JS "
"tab's stylesheet/script\n"
"  applied (not just the resolved CDN URLs), wrapped to match Canvas's own "
"content-area background\n"
"  and max width — a faithful \"what this will look like once uploaded to "
"Canvas\" check, updated\n"
"  live as you type or edit the theme.\n"
"- The editor and preview panes sit in a split view you can resize by "
"dragging the divider, stack\n"
"  vertically instead of side by side, and swap the order of (drag a pane's "
"toolbar onto the other,\n"
"  or use the **Swap panes** button). Each pane has its own fullscreen "
"button.\n"
"- The **Edit theme** tray's **Config** tab holds the CDN provider/theme/mode "
"selects and\n"
"  **Download theme.css** / **Download theme.js** links; its **CSS**/**JS** "
"tabs are editable copies\n"
"  of the generated files — hand-edit them and the preview picks up your "
"changes directly. Changing\n"
"  a Config select re-generates the CSS/JS tabs unless you've already edited "
"them, in which case a\n"
"  **Regenerate from config** button appears instead of silently overwriting "
"your edit.\n"
"\n"
"## Workflow\n"
"\n"
"1. Upload `theme.css` and `theme.js` to Canvas's Theme Editor (**Advanced → "
"CSS / JavaScript**) so\n"
"   pantoken's classes are available on every page.\n"
"2. Run `npm run dev`, use **Layouts** to start from a bundled starter, and "
"edit it like you\n"
"   would in Canvas's own RCE.\n"
"3. Click **Copy HTML** and paste the result into a Canvas page's RCE (switch "
"to the HTML editor\n"
"   view first). Canvas sanitizes pasted HTML server-side — this scaffold "
"doesn't attempt to\n"
"   replicate that, so always verify the pasted result in Canvas (see \"Notes "
"on Canvas's RCE\"\n"
"   below).\n"
"\n"
"## Notes on Canvas's RCE\n"
"\n"
"The Canvas Rich Content Editor runs TinyMCE and sanitizes submitted HTML on "
"the server against an\n"
"allowlist (`gems/canvas_sanitize` in canvas-lms, kept in sync with TinyMCE's "
"own\n"
"`valid_elements`/`extended_valid_elements`). What that allowlist means for "
"templates built here:\n"
"\n"
"- `class`, `id`, `style`, `title`, `role`, and `aria-*` attributes are "
"allowed on every element —\n"
"  pantoken's `class=\"instui-*\"` styling hooks (and inline `style`, e.g. "
"for CSS anchor positioning)\n"
"  **do** survive being pasted and saved, contrary to older guidance in this "
"file. `<script>` tags\n"
"  are always stripped.\n"
"- **RCE-safe pantoken components**: static/display components — alert, view, "
"heading, text, table,\n"
"  a button-as-`<a>` (not a real `<button>`), blockquote. Stick to semantic "
"HTML pantoken already\n"
"  supports (`div`, `p`, `span`, `a`, `img`, headings, lists, tables).\n"
"- **RCE-unsafe**: anything from `@pantoken/interactions`'s behavior set — "
"modal, tooltip,\n"
"  drilldown, close-button, or any other component driven by the native "
"`popover`/`popovertarget`/\n"
"  `command`/`commandfor` attributes. Those attributes aren't in Canvas's "
"sanitizer allowlist, so\n"
"  the markup survives but the interactive behavior silently breaks the first "
"time the page is\n"
"  saved in Canvas, even with `theme.js`'s `@pantoken/interactions` loader "
"present. Real form\n"
"  elements (`input`, `form`, `button`, `select`, `textarea`, `label`) and "
"inline `<svg>` are\n"
"  stripped outright — none of the bundled starter templates use them.\n"
"\n"
"`theme.js` loads `@pantoken/interactions` from the CDN, which runs in "
"Canvas's global page scope —\n"
"useful for interactions on pages you build directly in Canvas's RCE with raw "
"HTML edits, but (per\n"
"above) any `popover`/`command`-attribute-driven markup pasted from the RCE "
"preview here won't stay\n"
"interactive once saved.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Sócmhainní réidh le huachtar do Eagarthóir Téama Canvas LMS, móide "
"réamhbhreachú áitiúil le haghaidh teimpléadacha leathanaigh Eagarthóir Ábhar "
"Saibhir (RCE) a dhéanamh stílithe le\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Cad atá anseo\n"
"\n"
"- `theme.css` / `theme.js` — uachtar an dá chomhad seo faoin **Eagarthóir "
"Téama → Casta** i Canvas.\n"
"  Tógtha do an soláthraí CDN/téama/mód a roghnaigh tú nuair a scafálaíodh "
"(`--cdn`/`--theme`/\n"
"  `--theme-mode`; jsDelivr/atbhrandáil/soilsiú de réir réamhshocruithe) agus "
"leabharann ar ghreamanna\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (ceangal suas iompraíochta comhpháirt ar nós "
"modal, barúil, agus drilldown).\n"
"- `index.html` / `src/main.ts` — eagarthóir áitiúil, TinyMCE-bhunaithe (`npm "
"run dev`) a dhéanann léiríú ar RCE Canvas\n"
"  ionas gur féidir leat teimpléadacha leathanaigh a dhéanamh i gcoinne "
"ranganna pantoken sula gcóipeáil tú iad isteach i Canvas.\n"
"  Tógtha an leathanach féin le leagan amach `wrapper` pantoken: cliceáil "
"**Eagarthóir Téama** a oscailt cúr\n"
"  le **Cumrasc** / **CSS** / **JS** taibhsí (roghanna soláthraí CDN/téama/"
"mód, agus cóipeanna comhréir-soilsithe,\n"
"  in-eagarthóra de `theme.css`/`theme.js` a bhreacadh an réamhbhreachú "
"bheo), agus an cnaipe **?**\n"
"  le haghaidh treorach iomlán. Úsáid an cnaipe **Leagain** a thosú ó cheann "
"de leagain tosaigh bhaiphe pantoken\n"
"  (baothghaoth, fógra, dhá stlabh, nóta rubric, fianaise), a bhreacadh ó\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts).\n"
"\n"
"## Forbairt\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Osclaíonn sé seo freastalaí fhorbairt Vite le:\n"
"\n"
"- Páin **eagarthóir** (TinyMCE, ag meaitseáil an leagain/chumrasc\n"
"  [instructure/canvas-lms](https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms) féin a "
"úsáideann — féach thíos).\n"
"  Úsáid an cnaipe **Leagain** a lódáil ceann de na leagain tosaigh baiphe "
"(cuireann sé seo an doiciméad ar fad in ionad ionsáinn ag an chúrsóir), agus "
"an togarmharc **Cód foinse** a chur in oiriúint\n"
"  chun an HTML a eagarthóir i bhfianaise-soilsithe (CodeMirror) a bheith le "
"feiceáil ar leis an réamhbhreachú páin ag nuashonrú\n"
"  beo agus a bhí tú a scríobh — murab ionann agus breiseán TinyMCE stoc "
"`code`, a eagarthóir in\n"
"  spréacharnach aontréimhsiúil gan réamhbhreachú bheo.\n"
"- Páin **réamhbhreachú** a thaispeáint ábhar an eagarthóir le stíleabhair/"
"script na taibhsí CSS/JS atá ann faoi láthair\n"
"  i bhfeidhm (ní hionann agus na CDN URLs réisithe), fillithe chun "
"meaitseáil fhundo-limistéar Canvas féin\n"
"  agus leithead uasta — seiceáil thréanúil \"cad atá ag dul a bheith i "
"bhfianaise ar an uachtar go Canvas\", nuashonraithe\n"
"  beo agus a bhí tú a scríobh nó an téama a eagarthóir.\n"
"- Suíonn páin an eagarthóir agus réamhbhreachú i bhfianaise-roinnte páin is "
"féidir leat a athrú trína dhragging an roinnteoir, bolgán\n"
"  ina seasamh in ionad taobh ar thaobh, agus an ordú a malartú (drag páin "
"bharra foga ar an cheann eile,\n"
"  nó úsáid an cnaipe **Páin a Mhalartú**). Tá cnaipe fomhéin-lánchruth ar "
"gach páin.\n"
"- Tá taibhsí **Cumrasc** an tray **Eagarthóir Téama** ar an soláthraí CDN/"
"téama/mód agus\n"
"  naisc **Íoslódáil theme.css** / **Íoslódáil theme.js**; a taibhsí **CSS**/"
"**JS** leabharanna ionchiollach\n"
"  na comhaid ghinte — a eagarthóir iad agus an réamhbhreachú do do athruithe "
"a phiocadh suas go díreach. Athrú\n"
"  roghnúchán Chumrasc a athuachtar na taibhsí CSS/JS ach mura bhfuil tú in "
"ann a eagarthóir iad cheana, a bhí\n"
"  cnaipe **Athuachtar ó Chumrasc** ann in ionad go foluain a scríobh do "
"eagarthóireacht.\n"
"\n"
"## Sreabhadh oibre\n"
"\n"
"1. Uachtar `theme.css` agus `theme.js` go Eagarthóir Téama Canvas (**Casta → "
"CSS / JavaScript**) ionas\n"
"   go bhfuil ranganna pantoken ar fáil ar gach leathanach.\n"
"2. Rith `npm run dev`, úsáid **Leagain** a thosú ó leagan tosaigh baiphe, "
"agus a eagarthóir ar an gcaoi\n"
"   ar a bheadh tú i RCE Canvas féin.\n"
"3. Cliceáil **Cóip HTML** agus greamaigh an toradh isteach i leathanach RCE "
"Canvas (athrú go bhféachaint HTML\n"
"   ar dtús). Sanitizeann Canvas an HTML atá greamaithe ar fhreastalaí an "
"taoibh — ní dhéanann an scéim seo\n"
"  iarraidh ar athrá a dhéanamh air, mar sin fíorú go i gcónaí ar an toradh "
"greamaithe i Canvas (féach \"Nótaí ar RCE Canvas\"\n"
"   thíos).\n"
"\n"
"## Nótaí ar RCE Canvas\n"
"\n"
"Ritheann Canvas Rich Content Editor TinyMCE agus sanitizeann sé an HTML a "
"dhíoladh ar an fhreastalaí i gcoinne\n"
"liosta ceadaithe (`gems/canvas_sanitize` i canvas-lms, a choimeád i "
"gcomhshuí le\n"
"`valid_elements`/`extended_valid_elements` TinyMCE féin). Ar an gcéad seo a "
"chiallaíonn an liosta ceadaithe sin do theimpléadacha\n"
"atá tógtha anseo:\n"
"\n"
"- `class`, `id`, `style`, `title`, `role`, agus `aria-*` tréithe ar fáil ar "
"gach eilimint —\n"
"  hookanna stílithe pantoken `class=\"instui-*\"` (agus `style` comhfhillte, "
"m.sh. le haghaidh suí ankra CSS)\n"
"  **a bheith** fágtha ina fheidhm agus a shábháil, mar a bhí i gcontráirid "
"le treoir níos sine san fhaisnéis seo. `<script>` clib\n"
"  geal go i gcónaí.\n"
"- **Comhpháirt pantoken RCE-slán**: comhpháirt statach/taispeáinte — fhógra, "
"fhéachaint, ceanntásc, téacs, tábla,\n"
"  cnaipe-mar-`<a>` (ní fíor `<button>`), blockquote. Lean ar theangníomhach "
"HTML pantoken atá\n"
"  tacaithe cheana (`div`, `p`, `span`, `a`, `img`, ceannuiteoira, liostaí, "
"táblaí).\n"
"- **RCE-neamhábhartha**: fad ó thacar iompraíochta `@pantoken/interactions` "
"— modal, barúil,\n"
"  drilldown, dun-cnaipe, nó aon chomhpháirt eile spreabhtha ag an dúchas "
"`popover`/`popovertarget`/\n"
"  `command`/`commandfor` tréithe. Tréithe sin nach bhfuil i liosta ceadaithe "
"sanitizer Canvas, mar sin\n"
"  go bhíonn an marcanna fágtha ach an iompraíochta comhpháirt breise go "
"foluain an chéad turas ar fhórmáid\n"
"  go Canvas, fiú le loadeoir `theme.js`'s `@pantoken/interactions` i "
"láthair. Eilimintí fíor-fhoirme (`input`, `form`, `button`, `select`, "
"`textarea`, `label`) agus `<svg>` comhfhillte\n"
"  ar soghealadh go hiomlán — níl aon cheann de na leagain tosaigh baiphe á n-"
"úsáid.\n"
"\n"
"Lódaíonn `theme.js` `@pantoken/interactions` ó an CDN, a ritheann i scóip "
"dhomhanda leathanaigh Canvas —\n"
"úsáideach do idirghníomhaíochtaí ar leathanaigh atá tógtha go díreach i RCE "
"Canvas le eagarthóireacht HTML bhocht, ach (i bhfoluain\n"
"thuas) níl aon mharcanna `popover`/`command`-tréith-bhunaithe greamaithe ó "
"réamhbhreachú RCE anseo\n"
"beidh fágtha idirghníomhaíochta a shábháil.\n"

#: components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components), Instructure's\n"
"design tokens and icons.\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `index.html` holds the actual page markup — a `wrapper`-layout shell from\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts). View source\n"
"  and edit it directly; nothing is injected by JavaScript.\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` (document defaults + focus ring), "
"`components.css`\n"
"  (`.instui-*` classes), `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, "
"and other component\n"
"  behaviors out of the box), and your own `src/style.css` — add interactive "
"behavior here.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` in `index.html` — replace their contents with "
"your own markup.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Aip TypeScript simplí (trí Vite) stílithe le\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components), comharthaí dhearaidh agus deilbhíní Instructure.\n"
"\n"
"## Forbairt\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Cad atá ann\n"
"\n"
"- Coimeádann `index.html` an cód HTML iarbhír den leathanaigh — blaosc "
"leagan amach `wrapper` ó\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts). Féach ar an fhoinse\n"
"  agus cuir in eagar go díreach í; ní bhíonn aon rud insteallta ag "
"JavaScript.\n"
"- Iompórtálann `src/main.ts` `@pantoken/css` (sainmhíníonn gach maoin "
"shaincheaptha `--instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` (réamhshocruithe an doiciméid + fáinne "
"fócais), `components.css`\n"
"  (ranganna `.instui-*`), `@pantoken/interactions` (modal, tooltip, agus "
"iompair eile a chomhpháirt a nascadh go díreach),\n"
"  agus do chuid féin `src/style.css` — cuir iompair idirghníomhach leis "
"anseo.\n"
"- Tá pointí ionsáite roghnach (ceannlíne, scagairí, inneachar, tóir) "
"marcáilte le\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` i `index.html` — cuir ionad ar a n-inneachar le "
"do mharcáil féin.\n"
"- Cuir ranganna ar nós `class=\"instui-button\"` i bhfeidhm ar an mharcáil; "
"féach ar an\n"
"  [tagairt na gcomhpháirteanna](https://pantoken.app/api/css) don liosta "
"iomlán de na ranganna.\n"
"\n"
"## Foghlaim a thuilleadh\n"
