#: svelte/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A Vite + Svelte app styled with [`@pantoken/components`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components)\n"
"and [`@pantoken/svelte`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/svelte) "
"(icon action + token reads).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` calls `register()` (from `@pantoken/svelte`) once at "
"bootstrap so elements like\n"
"  `<instui-icon>` work in templates, and imports the token CSS plus "
"`@pantoken/interactions`\n"
"  (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component behaviors out of the box).\n"
"- `src/App.svelte`'s markup is styled with `instui-*` classes; optional "
"insertion points (header,\n"
"  filters, content, trailing) are marked with `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [getting started guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Aip Vite + Svelte stílithe le [`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/"
"package/@pantoken/components) agus [`@pantoken/svelte`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/svelte) (gníomh an deilbhín + léamh "
"tochail).\n"
"\n"
"## Forbairt\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Cad atá ann\n"
"\n"
"- Glaonn `src/main.ts` ar `register()` (ó `@pantoken/svelte`) fadó amháin ar "
"an tosach ionas go n-oibríonn eilimintí cosúil le `<instui-icon>` i "
"dtéacsáin, agus iompórtálann sé an CSS tocail móide `@pantoken/interactions` "
"(cumraíonn sé modal, leideog, agus gníomhaíochtaí comhpháirte eile díreach "
"amach).\n"
"- Tá marcáil `src/App.svelte` stílithe le ranganna `instui-*`; marcáilte "
"pointí leagtha isteach roghnach (ceanntásc, scagairí, inneachar, deireanach) "
"le `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Cuir ranganna cosúil le `class=\"instui-button\"` i bhfeidhm ar marcáil; "
"féach ar an [tagartha comhpháirte](https://pantoken.app/api/css) ar son "
"liosta iomlán na ranganna.\n"
"\n"
"## Breis a fhoghlann\n"
"\n"
"Féach ar an [treorú tosú](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) chun "
"breis a fhoghlann.\n"

