#: web-components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and using\n"
"framework-agnostic custom elements from\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` classes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box), and `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registers elements like "
"`<instui-icon>`), then\n"
"  renders markup into `#app`.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — replace their contents with your own markup.\n"
"- Use custom elements directly in markup, e.g. `<instui-button>`, `<instui-"
"alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  see the [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for the full element list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Feidhmchlár simplí TypeScript (trí Vite) stílithe le\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"agus ag úsáid eilimintí saincheaptha atá neamhspleách ar fhramework ó\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Forbairt\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Cad atá anseo\n"
"\n"
"- ionportálann `src/main.ts` `@pantoken/css` (sainmhíníonn gach `--instui-*` "
"custom property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (aicmí `.instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (nascann suas modhal, leideanna, agus "
"iompraíochtaí comhpháirt eile as an bhosca), agus\n"
"  `@pantoken/web-components` (einíonn eilimintí ar nós `<instui-icon>` go "
"huathoibríoch), ansin\n"
"  rendálann sé marcanna isteach in `#app`.\n"
"- Pointí ionsúite roghnach (ceannúlach, scagairí, ábhar, deireanach) a bhí "
"marcáilte le\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — ionadaigh a n-ábhar le do mharcanna féin.\n"
"- Úsáid eilimintí saincheaptha go díreach i marcanna, e.g. `<instui-"
"button>`, `<instui-alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  féach ar an [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/"
"package/@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  do liosta iomlán na n-eilimintí.\n"
"\n"
"## Tuilleadh a fhoghlaim\n"
"\n"
"Féach ar an [treorú HTML](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) chun níos "
"mó a fhoghlaim.\n"
